    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "La̱k Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar in rɛwdɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuäär ni Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar ruaacni ti̱ti̱ jäkä naath diaal kɛnɛ döör diaal kɛ nɛy tin ruac kɛ thuk ti gööl wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n wëë i̱, “Ɛ mal tekɛ yɛ! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän tɛth lɔcdä kɛ ɣöö bä yɛ la̱t nyuuthni kɛnɛ tin ga̱ykɛ naath tëë ci Kuoth in Di̱t ni Jɛn kɛ la̱t kɛ kui̱dä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɣän Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar, ɣän la ciëŋä agɔaa dhɔrä rɛy riäŋä mi di̱i̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɣän cua̱ nyuuth nɛn kɛ la̱k mi cu ɣä jakä dual, kä ɣän mëë ta̱a̱ tɔ̱ɔ̱cä dhaŋädä, cu nyuuth pua̱a̱ny in ci ben wi̱i̱dä ɣä jak kä dual. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän cua̱ ruac jäkä raar kɛ ɣöö ba ji̱ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn tin pɛl pɛl nööŋ nhiamdä, kɛ ɣöö ba ɣä ben la̱t luɔt läkä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ti̱t kɛnɛ göök ka̱a̱cni kɛ ji̱ kuthni kɛnɛ ji̱ kolaaŋni ben, kä cua̱ kɛ la̱t la̱k, duundɛ ɣöö /ken kɛ ɣä luäŋ kɛ lät luɔtdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ jɔak, cu Da-ni-yel ben nhiamdä, kä cua̱ jɛ la̱t la̱k. (Jɛn cɔalkɛ jɛ Bel-tɛ-ca-dhar kɛ ciöt Kuɔthdä, kä jɛn tëë kɛ yiëë kuthni mi gɔaa) cua̱ wee i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Bel-tɛ-ca-dhar, bo̱o̱th ti̱tni, ɣän ŋa̱cä jɛ ɛn ɣöö ji̱n ci thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ yiëë kuthni mi gɔaa, kä thilɛ mi gääy naath mi bum kä ji̱. Kä la̱k in cä nɛn jɛn ɛn, lätni ɣä luɔtdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Kä min caarä nyuuth ɛmɔ tɔ̱ɔ̱cä rɛy dhaŋädä cua̱ jääk Kuɔth Nhial mi tiit ŋɔak, nɛn bëë piny nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ruac kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Kä mɛmɛ ɛ jɛn la̱k ëë cä nɛn ɣän Kuäär ni Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar. Täämɛ ji̱n Bel-tɛ-ca-dhar lätni ɣä min lotdɛ, min /ken ji̱ kuäärädä tin pɛl pɛl ɛ luäŋ ɛn ɣöö ba ɣä la̱t luɔtdɛ. Bi jɛ luäŋ pa̱ny, kɛ ɣöö ji̱n ci thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ yiëë kuthni mi gɔaa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "La̱t Da-ni-yel kɛ luɔt läkä min rɛwdɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Da-ni-yel in cɔal kɛ bä Bel-tɛ-ca-dhar wi̱cdɛ yi̱c kɛ gua̱a̱th mi tɔt. Kä cu cärkɛ jɛ moc dual mi di̱i̱t. Kä cu kuäär ɛ jiök i̱, “Bel-tɛ-ca-dhar, a la̱k kɛnɛ luɔtdɛ /ci ji̱ bi jakä dual.” Kä cu Bel-tɛ-ca-dhar ɛ loc wëë i̱, “Kuäärä, dëë go̱r ni mi ku la̱k lɛ lot ni nɛy tin lökɛ ji̱, kä dee luɔtdɛ cu lot ni ji̱ tɛ̈ru! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn jiath ëë ci nɛn, min bär kä bum. Yiɛth wi̱cdɛ ni pua̱a̱r, kä nɛ̈nkɛ jɛ pëkni ɣɔaa diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji̱thkɛ tekɛ maan mi di̱i̱t kä ŋuan dɛykɛ ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kä jek ti diaal mi̱eth thi̱n, kä cieŋ ley dɔaar diaal thaarɛ, kä ci diit diaal duëlkiɛn la̱t karikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn jiath ɛmɔ ɛ ji̱n lö kuäär! Ji̱n ci piith a di̱t kä bumi. Ci di̱tdu rɔɔdɛ rep ɛ cɛ räth ni puɔ̱ɔ̱rä, kä ci ruecdu pëk ɣɔaa diaal cop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ti̱i̱ cärä läkädu lö kuäär, curi jääk Kuɔth nɛn bëë piny nhial kä wëë i̱, ‘Jɔapɛ jiath piny kä da̱kɛ jɛ, kua tharɛ kɛnɛ ciökɛ lɛ pa̱l rɛy muɔ̱ɔ̱n, kä gölɛ jɛ kɛ ladiit kɛnɛ ciɛk in yian, a jɛ te rɛy juaacni dɔaar. Kä a jɛ dëmkɛ ikä ɛ thäc puɔ̱ɔ̱rä, kä a jɛ cieŋ kɛɛl kɛ ley dɔaar, amäni mi ci run da̱ŋ bärɔw thuuk.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mɛmɛ ɛ jɛn luɔt läkä lö kuäär, kä jɛn ɛ ruac Kuɔth in Di̱t ni Jɛn ci ben kä ji̱ mɔ lö kuäärä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱n ba ji̱ woc rɛy nath, kä bi wä cieŋ kɛɛl nikɛ ley dɔaar. Kä ba ji̱ jakä laaki ni wal ce̱tkɛ ɣɔ̱k, kä bi puaak nikɛ thäc puɔ̱ɔ̱rä, kä bi run da̱ŋ bärɔw thuk ni dɔɔr, amäni mi ci jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö Kuoth in Di̱t ni Jɛn ɛ jɛn la rueec kuäärä nath ɔ, kä la kämɛ kuäär ram min go̱o̱rɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ca lat ɛn ɣöö ba thar jiaath kɛnɛ ciökɛ päl, mɔmɔ lotdɛ ni ɣöö ba kuääru nyɔk kɛ luc ji̱ mi wi̱i̱ jɛ wä ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ram in te Nhial ɛ jɛn la rueec ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ lö kuäär ku lui̱kdä liŋ. Ji̱n ri̱t rɔɔdu kä dueerku kɛ lätni cuŋni, kä päl jiäku kä nhɔk ni nɛy tin ciaŋkɛ a jiäk, kɛ ɣöö bi ria̱ŋdu te thi̱n kɛ gua̱a̱th mi bäär.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cu la̱k Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar athuɔ̱k",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ti diaal ti̱ti̱ tuɔɔk kä Kuäär ni Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ thuɔ̱k päthni da̱ŋ wälrɛw cuɛ wä ja̱l wi̱i̱ duëël kuäärä min te kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cuɛ ruac wëë i̱, “Mɛmɛ /ciɛ jɛn Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn in gɔaa, mëë ta̱a̱thä ɛ ɣän kɛ buɔ̱mdä ala rɛk in di̱i̱t, kɛ kui̱ gɔɔyä wutädä?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ŋot rieetkɛ /kenkɛ ni thuɔ̱k kɛ ben raar thokdɛ, cu jɔw ben ni nhial wëë i̱, “Lö Kuäär ni Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar ca ruac ɛmɛ la̱r ji̱ ɛn ɣöö ca kuäär woc kä ji̱! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji̱n ba ji̱ woc rɛy nath, kä bi wä cieŋ kɛɛl nikɛ ley dɔaar. Kä ji̱n bi lak ni wal ce̱tkɛ ɣɔ̱k. Kä bi run da̱ŋ bärɔw thuk dɔɔr amäni mi ci jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö Kuoth in Di̱t ni Jɛn ɛ jɛn la rueec kuäärä nath ɔ, kä la kämɛ kuäär ram in go̱o̱rɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä niɛ wa̱nɔ cua luk Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar cu ŋok. Cua jɛ woc rɛy nath, kä cuɛ lak ni wal ce̱tkɛ ɣɔ̱k, kä cua jɛ demikä ɛ thäc nhial, cu mäni mëë ci miemkɛ piith ce̱tnikɛ gɔ̱k cuɔr, kä cu rio̱pkɛ piith ce̱tnikɛ rio̱p diɛɛt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Liak Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar kɛ Kuoth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
